  "note": "Total Assets = Total Liabilities + Equity reconciles to within BDT 2 (rounding). Discrete Q3 profit before tax is negative (-219,328,369) on a large negative tax provision (net deferred-tax benefit) while net profit after tax is positive (71,357,851) — arithmetically consistent (PBT - tax = net profit), not an error; the same pattern recurs across multiple quarters this year (see 2021_Q2.json). Discrete-quarter figures verified: components of operating income/expense/provision sum to their reported subtotals; Q1+Q2+Q3 2021 net profit (71,592,637 + 109,690,249 + 71,357,851 = 252,640,737) matches the report's own Jan'21-Sep'21 cumulative column exactly. All discrete Jul'21-Sep'21 figures independently confirmed against the comparative column in the bank's own 2022 Q3 report (source: BRPD-14-September-2022_Web.pdf) except EPS: that report restates Jul'21-Sep'21 EPS to 0.08 (vs 0.09 reported contemporaneously here), consistent with the same bonus-share-driven EPS restatement pattern documented in 2020_Q2.json/2021_Q2.json (paid-up capital rose from 8,358,386,710 at 30-Sep-2021 to 8,609,138,310 by 30-Sep-2022). Contemporaneous value (0.09) is kept per project convention."
